&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;Attentive® is the AI marketing platform for 1:1 personalization redefining the way brands and people connect. We’re the only marketing platform that combines powerful technology with human expertise to build authentic customer relationships. By unifying SMS, RCS, email, and push notifications, our AI-powered personalization engine delivers bespoke experiences that drive performance, revenue, and loyalty through real-time behavioral insights.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Recognized as the&amp;nbsp;#1&amp;nbsp;provider in SMS Marketing by G2, Attentive partners with more than 8,000 customers across 70+ industries. Leading global brands like Crate and Barrel, Urban Outfitters, and Carter’s work with us to enable billions of interactions that power tens of billions in revenue for our customers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;With a distributed global workforce and employee hubs in New York City, San Francisco, London, and Sydney, Attentive’s team has been consistently recognized for its performance and culture. We’re proud to be included in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deloitte.com/content/dam/assets-zone3/us/en/docs/services/deloitte-private/2025/us-2024-technology-fast-500-rankings.pdf&quot;&gt;Deloitte’s Fast 500&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;(four years running!),&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.attentive.com/blog/attentive-ranked-8-on-linkedins-2020-top-startups-list-in-the-united-states&quot;&gt;LinkedIn’s Top Startups&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/lists/cloud100/&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/a&gt; (five years running!),&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inc.com/best-workplaces/2025&quot;&gt;Inc.’s Best Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;, and the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hrc.org/resources/corporate-equality-index&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Human Rights Campaign Foundation&#39;s Corporate Equality Index&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build AI-driven products that empower marketers to acquire subscribers and drive sustainable revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to overall code quality and system architecture, providing both direct code contributions, code-reviews, and long-term technical leadership to support scalable, maintainable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop high-quality consumer experiences, ensuring software meets standards of performance, scalability, reliability, and usability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with Product Management and Design teams to deliver user-focused solutions while maintaining quality and minimizing technical debt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement robust testing and quality assurance practices, proactively preventing regressions through unit, integration, and automated testing strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply advanced software engineering and computer science principles to design, develop, and enhance complex software systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and integrate distributed and large-scale systems, leveraging system engineering, software engineering, and system integration best practices to deliver secure and reliable platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partial telecommuting is permitted; onsite at 136 Madison Avenue, 8th Floor, New York, New York 10016 when not telecommuting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MINIMUM REQUIREMENTS: &lt;br&gt;Bachelor’s degree or U.S. equivalent in Computer Science, Computer Engineering or related field plus 3 years of professional experience as a Software Engineer or any occupation, job title, position performing design, development, testing, deployment, and maintenance of scalable software applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Must also have the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 years of professional experience developing backend services and high-scale, data-driven applications using programming languages including Java, Python, and Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 years of professional experience building and maintaining modern, responsive, and scalable web user interfaces using React and TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 years of professional experience using modern frontend development tools including ESBuild, and Playwright to build optimized interfaces and implement automated UI testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 years of professional experience working in Agile development environments, collaborating with cross-functional teams of engineers, product managers, and designers to deliver high-quality, user-focused software solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 year of professional experience implementing Operational Excellence frameworks in cloud environments, focusing on proactive monitoring, incident management, automation, and cost optimization to maintain scalable, secure, and efficient systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 year of professional experience designing and working with scalable micro-services and modular front-end systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 year of professional experience deploying and managing cloud-based applications on modern cloud platforms, including AWS, leveraging managed Kubernetes services for scalable and resilient infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please submit resume online at: www.attentivemobile.com/careers#jobs or via email to careers@attentivemobile.com. Must specify Ad Code HSJG&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll get competitive&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.attentive.com/benefits&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;perks and benefits&lt;/a&gt;, from health &amp;amp; wellness to equity, to help you bring your best self to work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For US based applicants:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The US base salary range for this full-time position is $131,997 - $230,000 per year. annually&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;+ equity + benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our salary ranges are determined by role, level and location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
